# Code owners for the supply-chain-sensitive parts of the repository.
#
# A change to any path below asks @CodeHalwell for review, and — once
# "Require review from Code Owners" is enabled in the branch protection for
# `main` — cannot merge without it. These are the files that decide what
# users download and run: the CI/release pipeline, the two installers that
# are piped into a shell, the dependency policy and lockfile, and the
# security policy itself.
#
# Syntax: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

/.github/        @CodeHalwell
/install.sh      @CodeHalwell
/install.ps1     @CodeHalwell
/tyc/deny.toml   @CodeHalwell
/tyc/Cargo.lock  @CodeHalwell
/SECURITY.md     @CodeHalwell
